text The class bell rings.
text @[Tomoya]
text I should go...
text Just as I'm about to stand up from my seat, I feel someone grip my shoulder from behind.
sound C66.aac
text @[Voice]
text Oh? Where do you think you're going, Okazaki?
text I turn around and see the teacher's fake smile at close range.
sound C67.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You haven't been attending fourth period very often.
sound C68.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I'm going to make sure you stay from beginning to end today. Prepare yourself.
text @[Tomoya]
text Uhh, what am I supposed to prepare for?
sound C69.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Everything. Just stay where you are. Be respectful and stay there. Please stay there. Stay there no matter what.
text He's pushing me down into my seat with freakish strength.
sound C6A.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Remain in your seat until class is over. Got it?
text Satisfied, he returns to the podium.
