text (It's time...)
text Thirty minutes later, I take action.
text The teacher is busy with the lesson.
text However, despite writing on the blackboard with his back turned to the class, it's obvious that he's on guard.
text If I sneak around, I'll definitely be spotted immediately.
text I should be doing this brazenly.
text I stand up.
text As if it's completely natural, I calmly head for the door in silence.
text Everyone, including the teacher, is staring at me.
sound C6B.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Okazaki! Where do you think you're going...?
text Too late, suckers.
