text Spanish mackerel.
sound C6K.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text The neighborhood fish market cut me a deal on the fillets.
text She says that with a glimmer in her eyes.
sound C6L.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text They recommended it because they got some good ones in stock.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh? Then you got something out of it.
text I feel like this is a conversation two newlyweds would have.
sound C6M.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text The scientific name is Scomberomorus niphonius. It's actually called a Spanish mackerel.
text And suddenly, the newlywed conversation crashes into a wall.
sound C6N.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text They're a migratory fish in the Perciformes order and Scombridae family that can be widely found in temperate waters.
text @[Tomoya]
text I see. They must get around.
