text ?
text Kotomi is tearing off pieces of the tricolored bread. She turns to me with a blank look.
text @[Tomoya]
text I heard you're exempt from classes, but are you sure it's okay? Like, with your attendance days?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT12A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
