sound C7D.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I've always been like this since I was little.
text That's all she says.
text She must have received special treatment from teachers and other students her whole life.
text A girl with exceptionally good grades probably gets more than just compliments and respect, though.
text I'm sure she's been through a lot of rough stuff, too.
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's get used to it slowly. I'll stay with you the whole way.
text I say that in a cheerful tone.
text Still, if I spend all my time with her, it'll mess up my supplementary courses and make-up exams.
text I know.
text Why don't I get Kotomi to help me study?
text I'll get a personal tutoring session from the girl genius Kotomi Ichinose.
text She'll draw out my hidden talents one by one and my grades will skyrocket! Then I'll be accepted into a first-rate college and I'll have the time of my life.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text That's 100% impossible.
