text The bell rings and lunchtime officially starts.
text I can hear the noises from the front yard through the open window.
text Students eating their lunch on the grass, the sounds of them joking around with each other...
text Kotomi is the only one outside that circle.
text Although it's been protecting her all this time, it's also been isolating her.
text Our circumstances are polar opposites, but we're very much alike.
text This is the first time I've had that thought.
